-- Story load: Chica con arete de perla (Vermeer, Mauritshuis) (slug: chica-con-arete-de-perla) — draft state, pending Patrick's OK to publish
-- Pattern: autorretrato / girasoles loads (idempotent, accent-safe, docker cp + psql -f).
-- Deletes scoped per-artwork. One obra-level connection (Girl with a Pearl Earring 2003); no artist-level rows owned here.
